1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,170
Listen to an announcement at a gathering of student club leaders.

2
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,042
Man:

3
00:00:08,042 --> 00:00:12,210
The university is making some changes to the policies governing student organizations.

4
00:00:12,210 --> 00:00:16,250
One of these changes pertains to scheduling events at the last minute.

5
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:22,050
This creates extra work for the Student Affairs office and so effective immediately.

6
00:00:22,050 --> 00:00:25,892
All student clubs must submit their event plans to the Office for approval at

7
00:00:25,892 --> 00:00:27,280
least two weeks in advance.

8
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:32,119
Failure to comply with this rule may result in the cancellation of events.

9
00:00:32,119 --> 00:00:37,100
If you have questions, please contact the Student Affairs Office.
